1
00:00:00,349 --> 00:00:04,099
(Howard:)I'm a grown man
with a Master's degree in Engineering!

2
00:00:04,269 --> 00:00:07,609
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Excuse me, Mr. Fancy-Pants.

3
00:00:07,773 --> 00:00:09,603
(Howard's Mother(voice):)Want me to get you a popsicle?

4
00:00:09,775 --> 00:00:12,695
(Howard:)Cherry, please.

5
00:00:13,487 --> 00:00:17,197
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
I ate the cherry. All that's left is green.

6
00:00:17,366 --> 00:00:20,116
You make me wanna kill myself.

7
00:00:20,994 --> 00:00:22,624
- What's going on?
- I don't know.

8
00:00:22,788 --> 00:00:25,038
(Leonard:)Now they're just yelling about popsicles.

9
00:00:27,292 --> 00:00:29,922
(Leonard:)- Sounds like Penny really got to him.
- I'm not surprised.

10
00:00:30,087 --> 00:00:33,177
(Raj:)Despite his hard and crusty shell,
Howard is a very sensitive man.

11
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,220
(Raj:)Do you know he writes poetry?

12
00:00:36,427 --> 00:00:39,767
(Raj:)Mostly about men from Nantucket
and hermits named Dave...

13
00:00:40,222 --> 00:00:42,812
(Raj:)...but he does it with real sensitivity.

14
00:00:42,975 --> 00:00:44,395
[LISPING]
Hey, Hofstadter.

15
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:47,440
Word around the plasma lab
is you built a robot?

16
00:00:48,147 --> 00:00:51,187
- Yes, we did, Kripke.
- His name is Monte.

17
00:00:51,358 --> 00:00:55,198
Well, if you have any delusions about
entering him against the Kripke Crippler...

18
00:00:55,362 --> 00:00:58,782
...in the Southern California Robot Fighting
League Round Robin Invitational...

19
00:00:58,949 --> 00:01:01,029
...AKA the SCRFLRRI...

